    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d52">

                <pb facs="0160" n="86" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg86"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/5171b</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-31T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 31, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1456. Department’s 1426, May 22, noon.<anchor n="5" xml:id="d52-f1"/> Have you
                    received Department’s No. 1426, May 22, noon? What is disposition of Provisional
                    Government concerning publication of communication? Telegraph reply.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
